<title>SINGAPORE: SIA unit in new facilities in Beijing.</title>
<headline>SIA unit in new facilities in Beijing.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines said its fully-owned subsidiary Singapore Airport Terminal Services officially opened on Friday two new joint venture facilities at Beijing Capital International Airport.</p>
<p>The joint ventures are an inflight catering centre, Beijing Airport Inflight Kitchen, which has a US$18 million kitchen, and a ground-handling company, Beijing Aviation Ground Services.</p>
<p>Singapore Airport Terminal Services holds 40 percent and Beijing Capital International Airport has 60 percent in each of the two joint ventures.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
